{"id":"E-001","question":"增购用户是否比首购和换购用户有更高产品魅力评价？","analysis":"compare","finding":"增购用户APEAL加权均值为798.4，换购用户为783.6，首购用户为786.6。","metric":"APEAL_Index","group":"YPV_01","comparison":"增购 vs 换购/首购","delta":{"vs_replacement":14.8,"vs_first":11.7},"effect_size":0.162,"p":0.00000000000604,"n":[2481,1279,6177],"controls":[],"coverage":"FULL","weight":"APEAL_WT","strength":"directional","caveat":"uncontrolled","relation":"supports","targets":["H-001"],"parents":[],"hypothesis_id":"H-001"}
{"id":"E-002","question":"购买任务差异是否只由BEV/PHEV结构造成？","analysis":"robustness","finding":"在BEV与PHEV分层后，增购用户仍保持较高APEAL方向。","metric":"APEAL_Index","group":"YPV_01","comparison":"within SUPER_SEGMENT_DP","delta":{"BEV":12.5,"PHEV":15.4},"effect_size":null,"p":null,"n":{"BEV":[1703,801,4248],"PHEV":[778,478,1929]},"controls":["SUPER_SEGMENT_DP"],"coverage":"FULL","weight":"APEAL_WT","strength":"directional","caveat":"price_brand_model_uncontrolled","relation":"supports","targets":["H-001"],"parents":["E-001"],"hypothesis_id":"H-001"}
{"id":"E-003","question":"差异来自哪些子指数？","analysis":"compare","finding":"增购 vs 首购子指数差异：外观+19.3、驾驶+15.2、性能+15.1、座舱+12.5、安全+10.9、舒适+8.8，补能续航仅+1.3，差异集中在感性体验而非基础功能。","metric":"AEXT_Index AINT_Index AFUEL_Index ADRV_Index ASFTY_Index APERF_Index ACMFT_Index","group":"YPV_01","comparison":"增购 vs 首购","delta":{"AEXT":19.3,"ADRV":15.2,"APERF":15.1,"AINT":12.5,"ASFTY":10.9,"ACMFT":8.8,"AFUEL":1.3},"effect_size":null,"p":null,"n":[2481,6177],"controls":[],"coverage":"FULL","weight":"APEAL_WT","strength":"directional","caveat":"uncontrolled","relation":"refines","targets":["H-001"],"parents":["E-001"],"hypothesis_id":"H-001"}
{"id":"E-004","question":"控制价格、品牌和车型后差异是否仍存在？","analysis":"regress","finding":"OLS 控制能源类型、价格(CN_YNV_07)与品牌(MAKE_DP)后，增购相对换购系数+18.3(p=4.3e-07)仍显著，差异非价格/品牌/能源结构驱动。","metric":"APEAL_Index","group":"YPV_01","comparison":"增购 vs 换购 (controlled)","delta":18.3,"effect_size":null,"p":0.0000004308,"n":9450,"controls":["SUPER_SEGMENT_DP","CN_YNV_07","MAKE_DP"],"coverage":"FULL","weight":null,"strength":"supported","caveat":"OLS 未加权、横截面","relation":"rules_out","targets":["H-001"],"parents":["E-001","E-003"],"hypothesis_id":"H-001"}
{"id":"E-005","question":"城市层级是否调节购买任务关系？","analysis":"segment","finding":"增购用户APEAL在各级城市内均最高（T1 810.3/T2 790.3/T3 811.0/T4 837.3），无调节反转；Tier4样本偏小(n=57)。","metric":"APEAL_Index","group":"YPV_01","comparison":"增购 vs 首购/换购 within CITY_TIER_DP","delta":{"T1":24.5,"T2":7.9,"T3":4.0,"T4":54.9},"effect_size":null,"p":null,"n":{"T1":[450,1027,339],"T2":[1569,3766,791],"T3":[405,1197,125],"T4":[57,187,24]},"controls":["CITY_TIER_DP"],"coverage":"FULL","weight":"APEAL_WT","strength":"directional","caveat":"Tier4小样本","relation":"supports","targets":["H-001"],"parents":["E-004"],"hypothesis_id":"H-001"}
{"id": "E-006", "question": "AEXT_Index 差异由哪些具体题项驱动？", "analysis": "drilldown", "finding": "AEXT 模块仅含 1 个 rating 题（AEXT_R_01 外观造型，Δ+0.20, d+0.19, p=2.6e-08），外观指数差异由单一题项承载；本数据片段无创新感/个性表达等更高粒度题项。", "metric": "AEXT_Index", "group": "YPV_01", "comparison": "增购 vs 换购", "delta": {"AEXT_R_01": 0.2}, "effect_size": 0.194, "p": 2.6e-08, "n": [1279, 2481], "controls": [], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": "APEAL_WT", "strength": "directional", "caveat": "AEXT仅1个rating题项，item层下钻触底", "relation": "refines", "targets": ["H-001"], "parents": ["E-003"], "hypothesis_id": "H-001", "created_at": "2026-08-18T00:34:32.852863+00:00"}
{"id": "E-007", "question": "哪个控制变量产生 suppression 效应（+11.8→+18.3 放大）？", "analysis": "regress", "finding": "sequential coefficient path 显示增购 vs 换购 系数全程稳定 +18.3（能源/价格/品牌逐项控制 ratio=0.996），无 suppression；此前 +11.8→+18.3 的放大是参照组混淆：+11.8 为增购 vs 首购、+18.3 为增购 vs 换购（换购为最低基线），并非控制变量效应。", "metric": "APEAL_Index", "group": "YPV_01", "comparison": "增购 vs 换购 (sequential controls)", "delta": 18.3, "effect_size": null, "p": 4e-07, "n": [9937, 9450], "controls": ["SUPER_SEGMENT_DP", "CN_YNV_07", "MAKE_DP"], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": null, "strength": "supported", "caveat": "OLS 未加权；参照组须统一", "relation": "rules_out", "targets": ["H-002"], "parents": ["E-004"], "hypothesis_id": "H-002", "created_at": "2026-08-18T00:34:59.830516+00:00"}
{"id": "E-008", "question": "驾驶感受指数差异由哪些具体题项驱动？", "analysis": "drilldown", "finding": "ADRV 5 题下钻：差异主要由总体驾驶感受(ADRV_R_05, Δ-0.23, d=-0.215)承载，其次转向/操控手感（常规 R_02 -0.17、湿滑 R_03 -0.18），再是乘坐舒适度(R_01 -0.15)，制动最弱(R_04 -0.13)。驾驶差异集中在整车动态的整体印象与转向手感，而非单项功能。", "metric": "ADRV_Index", "group": "YPV_01", "comparison": "增购 vs 首购", "delta": {"ADRV_R_05": -0.23, "ADRV_R_03": -0.18, "ADRV_R_02": -0.17, "ADRV_R_01": -0.15, "ADRV_R_04": -0.13}, "effect_size": -0.215, "p": 6.2e-20, "n": [2481, 6177], "controls": [], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": "APEAL_WT", "strength": "supported", "caveat": "delta 口径为 B-A（首购-增购），负值=首购更低", "relation": "refines", "targets": ["H-001"], "parents": ["E-003"], "hypothesis_id": "H-001", "created_at": "2026-08-18T00:35:19.104707+00:00"}
{"id": "E-009", "question": "为什么 AEXT_Index 差异（+19.8）显著高于 ADRV_Index（+11.7）？", "analysis": "drilldown", "finding": "指数层差距部分是聚合结构差异：AEXT 模块仅 1 个 rating 题（外观造型，差异全部由单一题承载，指数放大幅度大）；ADRV 模块由 5 题构成，差异分摊到每题 Δ-0.13~-0.23。因此'外观指数差异>驾驶指数差异'不能直接解读为'外观比驾驶更被重视'。", "metric": "AEXT_Index ADRV_Index", "group": "YPV_01", "comparison": "增购 vs 首购", "delta": {"AEXT_Index": 19.8, "ADRV_Index": 11.7}, "effect_size": null, "p": null, "n": [2481, 6177], "controls": [], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": "APEAL_WT", "strength": "directional", "caveat": "指数聚合结构差异", "relation": "explains", "targets": ["H-001"], "parents": ["E-006", "E-008"], "hypothesis_id": "H-001", "created_at": "2026-08-18T00:35:37.682836+00:00"}
{"id": "E-010", "question": "增购用户产品魅力优势的产品机制是什么？", "analysis": "synthesis", "finding": "增购（多为已有车辆家庭增购）用户对整车动态体验评价门槛更高且评价更高：驾驶差异由总体驾驶感受与转向/操控手感承载（ADRV_R_05/R_02/R_03），外观由单一造型题承载；该优势在控制价格/品牌/能源后稳健（E-004,E-007），且无 suppression（参照组混淆已排除）。产品机制：对增购人群，产品沟通与设计重点应落在可感知的整车动态体验（转向手感、整体驾驶印象）与外观造型，而非基础补能/单项功能。", "metric": "APEAL_Index ADRV_Index AEXT_Index", "group": "YPV_01", "comparison": "增购 vs 首购/换购", "delta": null, "effect_size": null, "p": null, "n": [2481, 6177, 1279], "controls": [], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": "APEAL_WT", "strength": "supported", "caveat": "机制为推断(Inference)；横截面数据", "relation": "explains", "targets": ["H-001"], "parents": ["E-006", "E-007", "E-008"], "hypothesis_id": "H-001", "created_at": "2026-08-18T00:35:37.722951+00:00"}
{"id": "E-011", "question": "车型/品牌×价格结构内增购vs首购差异还剩多少？", "analysis": "regress", "finding": "控制市场细分(SEGMENT_DP级别代理)+品牌+价格+能源后，增购系数+18.17(p=5.4e-07)，与基准+18.3几乎一致——全结构无法解释增购差异，主叙事经受最后大confounder检验。", "metric": "APEAL_Index", "group": "YPV_01", "comparison": "增购vs换购 (full structure controlled)", "delta": 18.17, "effect_size": null, "p": 5.4e-07, "n": 9450, "controls": ["SEGMENT_DP", "MAKE_DP", "CN_YNV_07", "SUPER_SEGMENT_DP"], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": null, "strength": "supported", "caveat": "无车型级列，SEGMENT_DP为市场细分级代理", "relation": "rules_out", "targets": ["H-003"], "parents": ["E-004"], "hypothesis_id": "H-003", "created_at": "2026-08-18T05:46:50.077323+00:00"}
{"id": "E-012", "question": "ADRV驾驶差异对应哪些产品属性/配置？", "analysis": "config_match", "finding": "记忆座椅对驾驶感受(ADRV)匹配效应+19.3(75%cells一致)、主驾通风+13.3；增购记忆座椅拥有率41.9% vs 首购24.4%，但换购拥有率最高(49%)且APEAL最低——配置多寡不能解释增购优势，差异在感知体验本身。", "metric": "ADRV_Index", "group": "SCR_SEAT00_04C_R1", "comparison": "matched config→driving", "delta": {"memory_seat": 19.3, "ventilation": 13.3}, "effect_size": null, "p": null, "n": 32, "controls": ["MAKE_DP", "CN_YNV_07"], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": "APEAL_WT", "strength": "directional", "caveat": "配置关联非因果；换购拥有率最高但评分最低", "relation": "explains", "targets": ["H-001"], "parents": ["E-008"], "hypothesis_id": "H-001", "created_at": "2026-08-18T05:48:33.658627+00:00"}
{"id": "E-013", "question": "增购×价格带交互是否成立（融合T1+T4）？", "analysis": "segment", "finding": "增购vs首购差距非单调：峰值在15-20万(+20.4)，30万+收窄至+1.4(首购也拉满803.5)；增购vs换购差距全价位带稳定(+14~24)。融合假设（越高价格带增购越要求升级感）被拒——真实结构是：中端带增购溢价最强，高端任务趋同。", "metric": "APEAL_Index", "group": "YPV_01 x price band", "comparison": "增购vs首购/换购 by band", "delta": {"15-20万_vs_首购": 20.4, "30万+_vs_首购": 1.4, "全带_vs_换购": 19}, "effect_size": null, "p": null, "n": [2481, 6177, 1279], "controls": [], "coverage": "FULL", "weight": "APEAL_WT", "strength": "supported", "caveat": "分带样本量不等", "relation": "rules_out", "targets": ["H-004"], "parents": ["E-004", "E-011"], "hypothesis_id": "H-004", "created_at": "2026-08-18T05:49:00.842881+00:00"}
